rule_id|name|trigger|threshold|observed|action|status|official_source_url
A4-D01|Trailing profit confidence|Upper bound of the 95% CI on trailing ROI falls below zero.|ROI 95% CI upper < 0 over the trailing 500 settled bets|not evaluable - 0 settled priced bets|demote to paper, freeze stake at 0|armed_not_evaluable|https://www.nfl.com/injuries/
A4-D02|Closing-line value decay|Average closing-line value over the trailing window is negative.|mean CLV < 0 over the trailing 200 bets|not evaluable - no closing prices captured|demote to paper, re-fit before re-entry|armed_not_evaluable|https://www.nfl.com/injuries/
A4-D03|Drawdown breach|Peak-to-trough drawdown of the live bankroll exceeds the limit.|drawdown > 30% of the live starting bankroll|not evaluable - no live bankroll|demote to paper immediately, no re-entry inside 4 weeks|armed_not_evaluable|https://www.nfl.com/injuries/
A4-D04|Missing price snapshot|A live bet is placed without BOTH an opening and a closing price recorded in the price-snapshot store.|0 tolerated occurrences|0 priced bets placed; store has 0 opening and 0 closing prices|demote to paper and quarantine the affected bets|armed_not_evaluable|https://www.nfl.com/injuries/
A4-D05|Parameter drift outside pre-registered bounds|A re-fitted model parameter moves outside the band that was registered before the strategy went live.|"|delta| > 25% of the registered value for any rating parameter, or ridge/HFA outside the registered band"|not evaluable - no live strategy registered|demote to paper and re-register before re-entry|armed_not_evaluable|https://www.nfl.com/injuries/
A4-D06|Minimum live sample|The strategy has fewer settled bets than the minimum needed to separate skill from luck.|>= 1000 settled bets to be eligible for live|0 settled priced bets|cannot be promoted; stays paper|armed_blocking_promotion|https://www.nfl.com/injuries/
